<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina places repos, reverse repos.</title>
<headline>Argentina places repos, reverse repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Wednesday it placed $700,000 in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>The bank also said it placed $5.76 billion in overnight reverse repos July 22 at 5.0 percent.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar rose to 0.99983 pesos from 0.99982 pesos at the close Tuesday.</p>
<p>Call money rose to 6.85 percent from 6.6 percent at the close Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
